---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { breadcrumbListSchema } from "../../utils/schema";

const schema = [breadcrumbListSchema([{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/privacy/" }])];
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Data Protection | Forbidden City Tours"
  description="How Forbidden City Tours handles data: analytics cookies, affiliate links, third-party services, and your privacy rights. Last updated September 2026."
  canonicalURL="/privacy/"
  schema={schema}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/privacy/" }]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-imperial">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-charcoal">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-10">September 10, 2026</time>. This site is an informational guide and does not require accounts or sell tickets.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 space-y-12">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal">We do not collect personal information directly. There are no accounts, no forms, and no ticket sales on this site. Like most websites, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes standard technical logs such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited for security and performance.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Analytics & Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal">We use Google Analytics (tag <strong class="text-ink">G-05RV5GYHPR</strong>) to understand which guides are useful. Google Analytics sets cookies and may process a pseudonymous identifier. You can opt out with <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-imperial underline underline-offset-2">Google's official opt-out browser add-on</a> or clear cookies in your browser at any time.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Affiliate Links & Third Parties</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal">Some tour links are affiliate links to booking platforms such as GetYourGuide. If you click through and book, those platforms process your booking data under their own privacy policies. We never receive your payment details. Official ticket sales happen only at dpm.org.cn, which operates under its own policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal">Because we hold no personal records, there is nothing for us to export or delete. For questions about this policy, email <a href="mailto:hello@forbidden-city-tour.com" class="text-imperial underline underline-offset-2">hello@forbidden-city-tour.com</a>. We may update this page as services change; the date above reflects the latest revision.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
